<title>JAPAN: Chuo Woollen -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chuo Woollen -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.82		vs	    2.35</p>
<p> Operating	  115    million	  vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Current	    143    million	  vs	  138    million</p>
