<p> EPS		    2.71 yen	  vs	    2.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     23 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chuo Woollen Mills Ltd is a medium-scale wool spinner.</p>
